{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102807","id":2333584992,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6LF65g","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102807","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102807.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102807.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102807","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102807/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102807/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102807/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/eaa02242567af97af6ac611dbf92d05b687d96ab","number":102807,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix delete Tile Source with delete key","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/83638\r\n\r\nFeels like a lot of code for a small feature. \r\n\r\nYou can now delete a selected Tile Source by pressing delete key when the Tile Sources ItemList has focus.\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250210_163741.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/350f39f0-dd8b-4b9c-b819-18684b49dac2)\r\n\r\n\r\n### This however introduced a new problem. \r\nWhen you selected a tile in the tile view (to the right of the ItemList) you could use delete to remove that tile. As the action about selecting tiles did not change focus. The result now was that you deleted the source instead of the selected tile.\r\n\r\nTo fix this I made the tile view grab focus on left mouse button press (Another method could be to change focus on mouse motion instead of press?). Hopefully this does not affect any other workflow. \r\n\r\nThis also made the delete selected tile with delete key more reliable to work, and not try to delete the TileMapLayer if TileSet editor had lost focus and you selected a new tile.\r\n\r\n**Delete selected tile**\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250210_162257.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c82534e-a1bb-4ea0-816a-93bbbde7a5f7)\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250210_162335.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c804b55-0f84-46ef-a05a-8ea2e1709ef2)\r\n\r\n\r\nAnother small benefit of the change in focus is that the E (erase) shortcut in Setup mode now works after you have selected a tile. This did not work if there was no other control that had focus in the tile editor. \r\n\r\n### Scenes Collection list\r\nAdd support for delete key. As it felt strange that it wouldn't work there too. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","defau